{"id":"717547fac08fc31f","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-presheaf-density.md","title":"Theorem — 每个预层是可表预层的规范余极限","display":"Theorem — 每个预层是可表预层的规范余极限","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-presheaf-density","aliases":["14-thm-presheaf-density"],"display":"Theorem — 每个预层是可表预层的规范余极限","source_ref":"I.5, pp.40–43","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]","[[14-thm-yoneda-lemma]]","[[14-df-presheaf-category-of-elements]]","[[14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-limits-and-colimits]]","[[14-df-isomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-presheaf-density"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-presheaf-density</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 每个预层是可表预层的规范余极限"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"I.5, pp.40–43"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99b72d10a7d872f5\" href=\"?note=99b72d10a7d872f5\" title=\"14-df-yoneda-embedding\">14-df-yoneda-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1291f8efcdef81cf\" href=\"?note=1291f8efcdef81cf\" title=\"14-thm-yoneda-lemma\">14-thm-yoneda-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d6de86836bb719f3\" href=\"?note=d6de86836bb719f3\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category-of-elements\">14-df-presheaf-category-of-elements</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"19ea095512403696\" href=\"?note=19ea095512403696\" title=\"14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-limits-and-colimits\">14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-limits-and-colimits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 为小范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 上的预层；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_P:\\int P\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(\\pi_P:\\int P\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 为上述构造。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,p)\">\\((C,p)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_{(C,p)}:yC\\to P\">\\(\\lambda_{(C,p)}:yC\\to P\\)</span> 是分量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_{(C,p),D}(u)=P(u)p\">\\(\\lambda_{(C,p),D}(u)=P(u)p\\)</span> 的自然变换。第二式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,\\kappa\">\\(Q,\\kappa\\)</span> 遍历同一图的候选余极限数据；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}\">\\(\\cong_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a> 的对象同构谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsColimit}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}\\bigl(P,(\\lambda_{(C,p)})_{(C,p)\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\int P)},y\\circ\\pi_P\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsColimit}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}\\bigl(P,(\\lambda_{(C,p)})_{(C,p)\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\int P)},y\\circ\\pi_P\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\\ \\forall\\kappa\\quad\\operatorname{IsColimit}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(Q,\\kappa,y\\circ\\pi_P)\\Longrightarrow P\\cong_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}Q.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall Q\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\\ \\forall\\kappa\\quad\\operatorname{IsColimit}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(Q,\\kappa,y\\circ\\pi_P)\\Longrightarrow P\\cong_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}Q.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对元素范畴箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widetilde u:(D,q)\\to(C,p)\">\\(\\widetilde u:(D,q)\\to(C,p)\\)</span>，记其底层箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=\\pi_P(\\widetilde u)\">\\(u=\\pi_P(\\widetilde u)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=P(u)p\">\\(q=P(u)p\\)</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_{(C,p)}\\circ y(u)=\\lambda_{(D,q)}\">\\(\\lambda_{(C,p)}\\circ y(u)=\\lambda_{(D,q)}\\)</span>。设有到预层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 的另一余锥 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_C(p)=\\mu_{(C,p),C}(\\operatorname{id}_C)\">\\(h_C(p)=\\mu_{(C,p),C}(\\operatorname{id}_C)\\)</span>。余锥相容性以及分量自然性推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_D(P(u)p)=Q(u)h_C(p)\">\\(h_D(P(u)p)=Q(u)h_C(p)\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:P\\to Q\">\\(h:P\\to Q\\)</span> 自然；再展开即得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\lambda=\\mu\">\\(h\\lambda=\\mu\\)</span>。反之任何因子映射在恒等箭头处必须有上述取值，故唯一。这既是密度表示，也是许多从可表对象延拓函子的起点。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，I.5, pp.40–43。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-yoneda-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"99b72d10a7d872f5","